{"id":"vod_md_5353","vodId":"5353","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"火影忍者 -博人传- 次世代继承者","name_cn":"火影忍者 -博人传- 次世代继承者","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"293集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230923-1/43d5fc1b6f178503f3fdd52bbd764da3.jpg"},"summary":"随着和平的到来而走向近代化的木叶忍者村。高楼林立，巨大显示屏中播放出影像，连结各区域的电车在村里奔驰。虽说是忍者村，但一般民众也增多，忍者的生存方式也在逐渐改变的这个时代——村子的领袖，第七代火影·漩涡鸣人的儿子慕留人，进入了培育忍者的学校“忍者学校”。周围的学生们带着“火影的儿子”这样偏见的目光看待慕留人，但慕留人凭借天生的破天荒性格将这种小事轻松越过！慕留人与新的伙伴相遇，他将如何挑战突然发生的神秘事件？在众人心中如疾风般狂奔的“漩涡慕留人”的物语，现在开始！！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画,冒险"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-23 07:49:41","classic":true,"classicRank":35,"franchise":"火影忍者","playable":true,"episodeCount":293,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/vC2WqctU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/FyNE2W76/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/PiNIVtcQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/8TgpkQLI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/WqDFlHDY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/0QdVXR0q/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/jnzIUjbN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/tsI5w7C4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/exyWKZEC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/oNOEzpsC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/Zv7RWLMt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/WZmQqBLD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/grlSIqrA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/fcQXUwo6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/3SieZm7R/index.m3u8